	(text "LOW-BATTERY BLINK (only while jack is plugged, VSW = boost EN rail)\nU3 = relaxation oscillator gated by VBAT: >3.45V steady (LED off),\n<3.45V red flashes ~0.1s, faster as battery drops (2.2s @3.4V, 1.5s @3.3V, 0.9s @3.0V).\nQ9/R19/R20: CHRG_N low (charging) -> Q8 on -> red solid. Green = STDBY (VBUS-powered).\nRed LED is fed from battery and switched by Q8, so TP4057 pins never see battery voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce51b80b-d11f-4395-9a57-89c17912e334")
	)
	(text "v2 changes: power-path (Q1,D2,R9) removed; TP4057 (500mA); MLCC instead of tantalum;\nL2 -> R23 47R RC filter; L3 -> R25 1R; R6 330k (Q2 base current 120uA -> 20uA);\nR4/R5 1M/470k; R22 1M EN pull-down (EN was floating when jack unplugged).\nR25 1R + C5/C6 = RC filter keeping boost ripple off the battery wires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "45cde947-e0d2-457c-ac08-e063d721d2e0")
	)
